000020C                88  TR-NEGADA                    VALUE 'N'.
000021C            05  TR-ESTABELECIMENTO     PIC X(20).
000022C            05  FILLER                 PIC X(05).
000037         FD  TRANS-APROVADA
000038             RECORDING MODE IS F.
