000152        *    AULA 9: VALIDACAO DO NUMERO DO CARTAO COM O SUBPROGRAMA LUHN
000153             MOVE TR-NUM-CARTAO     TO LK-NUM-CARTAO
000154             CALL WS-PGM-LUHN USING LK-AREA-LUHN
000155
000156             EVALUATE TRUE
000157                   WHEN LK-CARTAO-INVALIDO
